<title>USA: Micros-to-Mainframes receives agreement.</title>
<headline>Micros-to-Mainframes receives agreement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micros-to-Mainframes Inc said on Monday that its subsidiary Data.Com RESULTS received a network integration maintenance and support agreement with Webster Bank, a subsidiary of Webster Financial Corp.</p>
<p>The two year outsourcing business partnership with Webster Bank is estimated to generate $3 million in revenue.</p>
<p>Micros-To-Mainframes provides advanced technology products, including wide and local area networks, telecommunications solutions, as well as systems design consulting, maintenance and outsourcing services.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
